TAM-METER

Unprivileged C energy meter and live system monitor (D191).


USAGE

    tam-meter reading [--settle 360] [--minutes 10] [--interval 2] [--json]
    tam-meter now [--json]
    tam-meter top [--interval 2]


DESCRIPTION

- reading: Performs a candidate Test energy measurement (D170, D190).
- now: Immediate sample of power, temperature, and wakeups.
- top: Interactive live terminal monitor showing live power, sparkline,
  wakeups, and top CPU consumers.

Links libtam and libc only. No root required.
